   {:id "S3" :owner :reference :statement "A row and a set never unify, even with identical labels." :evidence "kind dispatch tests"}
   {:id "S4" :owner :both :statement "Record labels compare by name; common payloads unify; open tails absorb fields with payloads." :evidence "host and kinded record tests"}
   {:id "S5" :owner :both :statement "Schemes quantify type, effect, and row variables; instantiation freshens all three." :evidence "scheme tests"}
   {:id "S6" :owner :both :statement "An open effect set binds to concrete effects; two open sets meet at a fresh unknown." :evidence "effect-polymorphism tests"}
   {:id "S7" :owner :host :statement "Field access on an open record projects or extends the row; a missing closed field is refused." :evidence "field-access tests"}
   {:id "S8" :owner :host :statement "Effect subtraction removes a known label from a closed set and refuses an open remainder." :evidence "effect-subtraction tests; property labelSetSubtractionIsSetDifference"}]
  :runtime-sorts
  [{:id "V1" :owner :image :statement "Membership is structural over tensor values." :evidence "value-set membership tests"}
   {:id "V2" :owner :image :statement "Set algebra is union, intersection, complement over an explicit universe." :evidence "set-algebra properties"}
   {:id "V3" :owner :image :statement "Sealing narrows toward nominal equality; unname widens toward structural equality." :evidence "seal/unname tests"}
   {:id "V4" :owner :image :statement "There is no multiplicity and no order." :evidence "value-set tests"}
   {:id "V5" :owner :image :statement "The runtime sort is not the verification lattice; the bridge is deferred." :evidence "non-edge; deferred list"}]
  :runtime-shapes
